<title>MEXICO: Official results in Mexico congress vote at 0300 GMT.</title>
<headline>Official results in Mexico congress vote at 0300 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are preliminary official results from Mexico's Federal Electoral Institute (IFE) for Sunday's election of the lower house of Congress, the Chamber of Deputies.</p>
<p>NUMBER OF POLLING BOOTHS REPORTING: 10.82 percent of total.</p>
<p>   Institutional Revolutionary Party (PRI)	 36.58 percent</p>
<p>   National Action Party (PAN)			 30.62 percent</p>
<p>   Party of the Democratic Revolution (PRD)	23.79 percent</p>
<p>   Green Ecologist Party of Mexico (PVEM)	   4.09 percent</p>
<p>   Workers Party (PT)				     3.00 percent</p>
</text>
